===Urbanization===
Thyon is highly urbanised, with around 80% of the population living in cities. The most densely populated regions are around the [[Auser]] and [[Silma]] river valleys, and the [[Coast]]. The largest city is [[Rhempo]], which has an estimated a population of more than 12 million people. The Middle Auser Valley is the most densely populated part of the country, centered around the [[Fepo]] metropolitan area, there are 5 cities in the region with over 1 million inhabitants.
