===Ethnic groups and immigration===
[[Thyo-Merinise people]] are the primary ethnic group in Thyon, making up 78.1 percent of the population. Other significant ethnic minorities include the [[Aunanian people]], the [[Luserian people]] and the [[Noetetian people]], the former two being the majority ethnic groups in their respective [[Provinces of Thyon|province of Thyon]]. Thyo-Merinese people are concentrated in the Lower Auser Valley and the southern Maritime Union. 

